---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---
<Section id="projects" title="Selected projects">
  <article class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-6">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-muted">In progress</p>
    <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold">Fleet-tracking demo</h3>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-muted">
      An independent project with simulated vehicles: live positions on a map,
      geofence alerts, trip and stop detection, and a report. Original code and
      synthetic data only.
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted">
      <li class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">TypeScript</li>
      <li class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">PostgreSQL</li>
      <li class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">MQTT</li>
      <li class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Docker</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Section>